# Test fixture: checks that Dialogue Manager imports and compiles .dialogue files.
# Not used in the game.

~ start
Stranger: Hey. You dropped this.
- Take it
	$> GameState.set_flag("test_took_item")
	Stranger: Thought so.
- Ask who they are [if GameState.has_flag("test_met_stranger") == false /]
	Stranger: Nobody important.
=> END
